+## 8. Assessment & Feedback  
+
+- **In‑class participation** (30 % of lecture grade) – measured via poll responses, group activity contributions, and exit ticket.  
+- **Homework** (70 % of lecture grade) – evaluated on correctness, code style (comments, naming), and written complexity justification.  
