+
+---  
+
+## 8. Closing Remarks  
+
+Tokenisation may appear as a simple preprocessing step, yet it shapes the entire learning dynamics of modern language models. By understanding the underlying algorithms, their linguistic assumptions, and practical implementation details, students gain the ability to tailor NLP pipelines to diverse languages and tasks—an essential skill for both research and industry. The next lecture will build on this foundation by exploring how token sequences are turned into dense vectors through embeddings and positional encodings.  
