+              Set a learning goal
+            </h2>
+            <p className="mt-1 max-w-xl text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">
+              Pick a planning lens, name the exact topic, and add context. You can create a roadmap for any valid subject or outcome.
+            </p>
+          </div>
